4. Structure of a Spring Boot Project

project-root
│── pom.xml                 # Maven build file: dependencies, plugins
│── .gitignore              # ignored files for Git
│── HELP.md                 # documentation
│── .idea                   # IDE-specific configs
│── .mvn                    # Maven wrapper files
│── mvnw, mvnw.cmd          # Maven wrapper executables
│
└── src
    ├── main
    │   ├── java            # application code
    │   │    └── com.example.demo (packages)
    │   └── resources
    │        ├── static     # static files (images, CSS, JS)
    │        ├── templates  # HTML files (Thymeleaf, etc.)
    │        └── application.properties/yml # configurations
    │
    └── test                # test cases


