✅ Missing but Important Concepts Before Deep-Diving into Spring Boot

Profiles (@Profile) → switch configurations for dev/test/prod.

YAML config (application.yml) → more structured than .properties.

Exception handling → @ControllerAdvice, @ExceptionHandler.

Validation → @Valid, @NotNull, @Size.

Logging → built-in with SLF4J + Logback.

Testing → JUnit + SpringBootTest.



